          "prompt": "$3+5+7+\\cdots$ where $S_n=168$",
          "answerSpaceMm": 50,
          "answer": {
           "short": "12 terms.",
           "worked": "$a=3$, $d=2$.\n$$\\begin{align*}168&=\\frac{n}{2}[2(3)+(n-1)2]\\\\336&=n(2n+4)\\\\n^2+2n-168&=0\\\\(n-12)(n+14)&=0\\\\n&=12\\text{ or }-14\\end{align*}$$\nSince $n>0$, 12 terms are needed."
